  "description": "*\"I cannot forgive you for using me, the God of Astrology to deceive people!\"*\n\nIf fraud is a skill, Yoo Seol-Yeon who has a fraud skill score of 99, uses 100% of her talent to run a fortune telling shop.\n*\"Please save us, Goddess Diana!\"*\nWho am I? Where am I? Before I could even think, lots of people came in and the room falls into chaos... Soo Seol-Yeon, a fraudulent fortune teller possessed the body of the Goddess Diana. Will her skill work in this world as well?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: This is a promotional one-shot for the homonym novel.*",
